<title>PHILIPPINES: Guoco Holdings says net at 1.003 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Guoco Holdings says net at 1.003 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guoco Holdings (Philippines) Inc said on Tuesday its after-tax profit for the fiscal year ending June 30 reached 1.003 billion pesos. It did not give the comparative figure for last year.</p>
</text>
